{"seq":2,"slug":"latent-diffusion","title":"潜在扩散与 LDM","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-models/architectures/latent-diffusion","wordCount":1763,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"潜在扩散与-ldm\">潜在扩散与 LDM</h1><p>在像素空间直接跑扩散有个残酷的算术问题：一张 512×512×3 的图有近八十万个维度，要在这个空间里迭代几十步、每步过一遍大网络，显存和算力都顶不住——早期的像素空间扩散模型只能生成几十像素的小图，或者需要数据中心级别的硬件。2022 年的潜在扩散模型（LDM）用一个看似简单的转移破解了这个困局：别在像素上扩散，先把图压到一个小得多的潜空间，在那里扩散，最后再解码回像素。Stable Diffusion 的名字和它在消费级显卡上的可用性，都直接源于这一步。本篇拥有自编码器与潜空间压缩的全部产权。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-感知压缩加潜空间扩散\">核心概念：感知压缩加潜空间扩散</h2><p>LDM 把生成拆成两个独立训练的阶段。第一阶段是一个<strong>自编码器</strong>：编码器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{E}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0894em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 把像素图 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 压成低维潜表示 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z = \\mathcal{E}(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0894em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，解码器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{D}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 还原回像素 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde x = \\mathcal{D}(z)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。第二阶段才是扩散——但它完全在潜空间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 上进行，<a href=\"../foundations/ddpm\">去噪扩散概率模型 DDPM</a> 的全部公式原封不动，只是把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 换成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。生成时先在潜空间采出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，再一次性解码成图。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    X[像素图 512x512x3] --&gt;|编码器 E| Z[潜表示 64x64x4]&#10;    Z --&gt;|前向加噪| ZT[潜噪声 z_T]&#10;    ZT --&gt;|潜空间扩散去噪| Z0[采样潜表示 z_0]&#10;    Z0 --&gt;|解码器 D| XOUT[生成图 512x512x3]&#10;    COND[文本/条件] -.交叉注意力.-&gt; ZT&#10;    NOTE[扩散全程在 64x64&lt;br/&gt;而非 512x512] --&gt; Z\">flowchart TD\n    X[像素图 512x512x3] --&gt;|编码器 E| Z[潜表示 64x64x4]\n    Z --&gt;|前向加噪| ZT[潜噪声 z_T]\n    ZT --&gt;|潜空间扩散去噪| Z0[采样潜表示 z_0]\n    Z0 --&gt;|解码器 D| XOUT[生成图 512x512x3]\n    COND[文本/条件] -.交叉注意力.-&gt; ZT\n    NOTE[扩散全程在 64x64&lt;br/&gt;而非 512x512] --&gt; Z</pre><p>像素空间与潜空间扩散的代价对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>像素空间扩散</th>\n<th>潜在扩散 LDM</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>扩散张量尺寸</td>\n<td>512×512×3</td>\n<td>64×64×4（约 1/48）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单步算力</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低约一个量级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>训练硬件</td>\n<td>数据中心</td>\n<td>单张消费级 GPU 可微调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高频细节</td>\n<td>扩散直接负责</td>\n<td>解码器负责</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代表</td>\n<td>早期像素 DDPM</td>\n<td>Stable Diffusion 系列</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"自编码器-把感知冗余挤掉\">自编码器：把感知冗余挤掉</h2><p>这个自编码器的设计目标不是无损压缩，而是<strong>感知压缩</strong>——丢掉人眼不敏感的高频冗余，只保留语义和结构。它的训练借鉴了<a href=\"../foundations/generative-modeling\">生成式建模概览</a> 里的 VAE 与 VQ-GAN：损失里除了重建项，还加了对抗判别器（让解码图锐利）和感知损失（用预训练特征比对），并对潜空间施加轻微的 KL 正则或向量量化，防止它退化成任意编码。</p>\n<p>典型配置把空间分辨率降 8 倍（512→64）、通道压到 4，整体压缩约 48 倍。关键在于压缩率要恰到好处：压得太狠，解码器编不回细节，图会糊；压得太轻，扩散又省不下算力。LDM 论文的核心洞察是，图像里绝大部分比特花在了语义无关的高频纹理上，把这部分交给一个确定性的解码器去补，扩散模型就能专注于在低维潜空间里建模真正重要的语义结构。这是一种漂亮的分工：解码器管&quot;画得清不清&quot;，扩散管&quot;画得对不对&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"潜空间扩散-公式不变-代价骤降\">潜空间扩散：公式不变，代价骤降</h2><p>搬进潜空间后，扩散部分几乎是免费午餐——训练目标仍是那行噪声预测 MSE，只不过作用在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 上：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>LDM</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">[</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">∥</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">∥</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{LDM}} = \\mathbb{E}_{z_0=\\mathcal{E}(x),\\,t,\\,\\epsilon}\\Big[\\big\\|\\epsilon - \\epsilon_\\theta(z_t, t, c)\\big\\|^2\\Big]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">LDM</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0894em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.556em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.556em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 556 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\nM367 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M410 15 H367 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.556em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.556em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 556 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\nM367 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M410 15 H367 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.054em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.3029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 是条件（如文本嵌入），通过交叉注意力注入去噪网络，机制见<a href=\"conditioning-guidance\">条件控制与引导</a>。去噪网络本身可以是 <a href=\"unet-backbone\">U-Net 主干网络</a> 描述的 U-Net 或 DiT。因为张量小了近 50 倍，同样的硬件预算下可以训更大的网络、跑更高的分辨率，这正是 Stable Diffusion 能开源跑在游戏显卡上的根本原因。</p>\n<p>一个常被忽视但很要紧的细节：潜空间的统计特性会影响扩散质量。SD 1.x/2.x 用的是 4 通道、KL 正则的潜空间；SDXL 和 SD3 改用通道更多（如 16 通道）的自编码器，潜空间承载更多信息，重建上限更高，配合更强的去噪主干显著提升了细节。换言之，自编码器不是一劳永逸的固定组件，它和扩散主干是协同进化的——升级潜空间往往是新一代模型画质提升的隐形功臣。</p>\n<h2 id=\"潜在范式的连锁影响\">潜在范式的连锁影响</h2><p>潜空间扩散的影响远超省显存。其一，它让<strong>微调与定制</strong>变得廉价：在小潜空间上做 LoRA、DreamBooth 只需很少算力，催生了庞大的社区生态，这部分由<a href=\"../applications/controllable-generation\">可控生成与微调</a> 详述。其二，它让<strong>多模态扩展</strong>自然：潜空间只是张量，把图像潜空间换成视频潜空间（加时间维）或三维潜空间，同一套扩散机制就能迁移，见<a href=\"../applications/video-3d-diffusion\">视频与三维扩散</a>。其三，所有<a href=\"../sampling/\">采样与加速</a> 的技巧（DDIM、DPM-Solver、蒸馏）都在潜空间上同样适用且更划算。可以说，LDM 不只是一个优化技巧，它是把扩散从研究模型变成工业级平台的那块基石。</p>\n<h2 id=\"压缩率的权衡与常见误区\">压缩率的权衡与常见误区</h2><p>LDM 几乎全部的设计张力都压在一个旋钮上——压缩得多狠。这个取舍值得摊开看：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>压缩率</th>\n<th>扩散负担</th>\n<th>解码器负担</th>\n<th>结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>过轻（近乎像素空间）</td>\n<td>重，算力居高不下</td>\n<td>轻</td>\n<td>便宜了解码器，却没省下扩散</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适中（约 48 倍，4 通道）</td>\n<td>轻，可在消费级 GPU 跑</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>LDM/SD 1.x 的甜点区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过重（通道再少、分辨率再降）</td>\n<td>极轻</td>\n<td>极重</td>\n<td>解码器补不回细节，图发糊</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>配套的常见误区有三：以为&quot;自编码器是无损压缩&quot;（它刻意丢高频，是感知压缩）；以为&quot;潜空间通道数随便设&quot;（它直接决定重建上限与细节天花板）；以及以为&quot;换自编码器不影响扩散&quot;（实际两者的统计特性必须协同，换潜空间往往要重训或重调去噪主干）。</p>\n<p>这里还有一个更深层的代价容易被忽略：像素空间的扩散&quot;所见即所得&quot;，而潜空间扩散多了一道解码，任何解码器补不回的细节都会变成系统性上限——正是因为这一点，后来几代模型才不断升级自编码器，把它当成画质竞争的前线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>像素空间扩散维度过高、算力难承受；LDM 先用自编码器把图压进低维潜空间，再在那里扩散。</li>\n<li>自编码器追求感知压缩而非无损：用对抗+感知损失训练，把高频细节交给解码器，让扩散专注语义结构。</li>\n<li>搬进潜空间后训练目标不变，仅作用对象从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 变 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span>，张量缩小近 50 倍使扩散可在消费级 GPU 运行。</li>\n<li>潜空间的通道数与统计特性随代际升级（4→16 通道），自编码器与扩散主干协同进化，是画质提升的隐形功臣。</li>\n<li>潜在范式还让廉价微调、多模态扩展与采样加速顺理成章，是扩散从研究走向工业平台的基石。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"潜在扩散与 LDM","id":"潜在扩散与-ldm"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：感知压缩加潜空间扩散","id":"核心概念-感知压缩加潜空间扩散"},{"level":2,"text":"自编码器：把感知冗余挤掉","id":"自编码器-把感知冗余挤掉"},{"level":2,"text":"潜空间扩散：公式不变，代价骤降","id":"潜空间扩散-公式不变-代价骤降"},{"level":2,"text":"潜在范式的连锁影响","id":"潜在范式的连锁影响"},{"level":2,"text":"压缩率的权衡与常见误区","id":"压缩率的权衡与常见误区"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"U-Net 主干网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-models/architectures/unet-backbone"},"next":{"title":"条件控制与引导","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-models/architectures/conditioning-guidance"}}